# Speed floor

Live site: https://goodies-jade.vercel.app/

Do not let any change, including a new tab, API, page, or dependency, drop these Lighthouse scores:

- Performance: 99
- Accessibility: 93
- Best Practices: 100
- SEO: 100

If a requested change can slow the site, stop and warn before editing. Name the cost (extra JavaScript, a large image, a client component, a blocking request) and wait for approval.

## Keep

- Photos, banners, and logos go through `ImageComponent`. Pass `sizes`. `preload` only on the LCP hero. Quality 65 only for that hero, 75 elsewhere.
- Do not add `<img>`, CSS `background-image` for large photos, or `unoptimized` images.
- Do not load a library on the first screen unless it is code-split. No loop or autoplay that duplicates slides.
- Arabic font loads only on `/ar`. Do not add an unused font.
- Pages stay static. Do not add a client component, heavy dependency, or uncached fetch to the root layout without a warning.

## Check

Judge speed on a production build, not `next dev`. After a change that touches images, JavaScript, fonts, or data loading, say whether the Lighthouse floor is still safe.
